# __NAME__

C17 project. Sources and headers sit together in `src/`; `dist/` is build output and never committed. `Makefile` and `justfile` hold the same commands.

## Commands

- Build: `make build` (or `just build`)
- Run: `make run` (or `just run`)
- Check: `make check` (or `just check`), typechecker `__TYPECHECKER__`
- Lint: `make lint` (or `just lint`), linter `__LINTER__`
- Format: `make fmt` (or `just fmt`), formatter `__FORMATTER__`
- Clean: `make clean`

`.clang-format` and `.clang-tidy` are the toolchain defaults; Clang 16 or newer is assumed.
